{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c01089a27c451ff7bf2d80fa9317d540a75ca5df3b818fd785eac2b7696be874","ja":"みなさん、こんにちは。\n今日は劇場の控え室から、生配信をお届けします！","zh":"大家，中午好/大家好。\n今天将从剧场的休息室为大家带来现场直播！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"09552139ceedf37b3ee151da18c2bc7b19e80dd0a5a2439526f7f397df769381","ja":"「かいさいせんげん公演のみんなのバトルも見たい」","zh":"“也想看开幕宣言公演中大家的对决”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"69dc3645aec9d4aea0fd529a8ddc44a19afc5b63931fda7c9b796a207336ef92","ja":"……っていうリクエストをもらったから、\n今から6人で勝負するね！　","zh":"……收到了这样的点播，\n所以接下来我们要6个人一决胜负哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"dbe6cedbd82fda26948db1891177f2a6c370321ab3ed450fea111b3709cd4e58","ja":"ちょうど復活祭の季節ということで……。","zh":"正好也是复活节的季节……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ba3318105556591c557ea7bf2679509bbff94231681455fe15bc6f63eb6b2c2a","ja":"私たちがそれぞれ10個の卵を隠して、\nそれを他のお三方が探します。","zh":"由我们各自藏好10个彩蛋，\n再由另外三位来寻找。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ebcbafa3b4eb3970985f6431e19b53747cc63658e75cc41aaae037f59ab0a2e2","ja":"隠したイースターエッグが、\n一番見つけられなかった人……。","zh":"藏好的复活节彩蛋，\n被找到最少的人……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0d34fd3af986f4b0a53aa704e21a4fa6647c12d96dc45cd866f96b64374e350c","ja":"または、見つけたイースターエッグが\n一番多かった人が、勝利となります。","zh":"或者是找到的复活节彩蛋\n最多的人获胜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"16eeaa1da5e04050229686d020448625a9e936ea9e2267074045ebd1529c9e17","ja":"じゃあ、さっそく卵を隠していくぞ～！\nせいげん時間は15分、たまきの卵は、この黄色だよ！","zh":"那么，这就去把彩蛋藏起来喽～！\n限时15分钟，环的彩蛋是这个黄色的哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f78f81569cd348ee4bcbda93fc2afc578e7b23a92f5a82658b7a89e810f9b487","ja":"たなの上に置いたら、見えないよね？\nえいっ！","zh":"放在架子上的话，就看不见了吧？\n嘿！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"74f51624ca0c54e0d680bf189cd8068f825a14c14d91a78bcd14d23050f4f71d","ja":"Wow！　環さんすごい投擲技術です……！　あ、私は\n赤色の卵を……ええと、どこに隠しましょう……。","zh":"Wow！环小姐的投掷技巧真厉害……！啊，我把\n红色的蛋……那个，要藏在哪里好呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9d69c9be9a094339d8d9ff04e709ae024a54ddb1254814f2528377f9003f368b","ja":"あ、この鉢植えの陰に置くのはどうでしょう？\nここにこう置くと……見えなくなりました！","zh":"啊，放在这个盆栽后面怎么样？\n像这样放在这里的话……就看不见了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b3d9e0e41a9eb1f7b36fdab16c13856406ea76a91ce63b3c7e87acbc439f4faf","ja":"悪くないと思うけど、定番の隠し場所って、\n朋花さんとかに、すぐに見つけられちゃうかも。","zh":"我觉得挺不错，不过那些经典的藏匿处，\n可能很快就会被朋花她们给发现吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6e1cd822d670d6093985b9f3072bd18f65fdebe560d591cd7fac4244fb0b973a","ja":"はっ！　そうですね。ここはやめて、\nもう少し工夫を凝らしたほうが……。","zh":"啊！也是呢。这里还是先算了，\n稍微再花点心思琢磨一下会更好吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f2f9768ff519950cf707ce312927b02e8a42538d80e5941beccfd3aca2c34cc2","ja":"高いところに、ぽーんって投げるのが\nいいと思うぞ！　エミリーもマネしていいよ！","zh":"往高处“嗖——”地扔出去，\n我觉得挺好的哦！艾米莉也可以学学看！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"22739babc9374eb12b8264c54f830c1874da02a8d8c8edd1b735cd371f7155cf","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nでは……えいっ！","zh":"非常感谢！\n那么……嘿！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1591.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"26bcb3229708001120fdab5c073ee0e3363ad568d55f786f42b7b6e762e179da","ja":"ええっ！？　それだと、全部高いところに……って、\nもう5分経過！？　私の青い卵もはやく隠さないと！","zh":"诶！？那样的话，不就全都在很高的地方了……等等，\n已经过去5分钟了！？我也得赶紧把我的蓝蛋藏起来才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
